Top of inside of head - sahasrara petals - 'you'
Other side of petals - stem stick wand - sri lalitha - the gate
Upwand wand - cross - sri ganesha - the son
Upwand cross - crossed cross - plain swastic - maha dev shiv - the father
Upwand crossed cross - crossing crossed cross - dotted sri swastica - maha kali - the mother
